      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary artery anomalies are uncommon and the occurrence of a single coronary artery with no structural heart disease is very rare. We report a hitherto undescribed type of single coronary artery originating from the right aortic sinus giving rise to left main coronary artery and right coronary artery that was hypoplastic proximally."},
